<title>USA: U.S. DAP, AMMONIA VALUES MOSTLY STEADY.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, AMMONIA VALUES MOSTLY STEADY.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate values were mostly steady on Wednesday, underpinned by signs of a pick-up in demand in the export market, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are a few more tenders although not a lot of business yet,&quot; one DAP dealer said.</p>
<p>Ammonia prices were steady amid talk that supplies in New Orleans appear fairly tight.</p>
<p>				 Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-188		 dn 1-unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
